   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "p-h3-image text to image at 2912x2912 (8 MP) in 8 steps on the bf16 DiT, text encoder and VAE. ComfyUI builds this DiT as MiniMax H3, so it runs on the MiniMax H3 adapter: auto asks for sequence-parallel on a configured pair and single on one box, and at CFG 1 through Basic Guider (DGX Monarch) cfg-parallel has nothing to split. Write a short request after Request: in the request box and keep the Aspect ratio: line equal to the canvas. Generate Text runs the prompt upsampler on the driver and turns the request into the full prompt that Preview as Text shows. The vendor says the model renders full prompts much better than short ones, so keep the upsampler on. The If/Else switch set to false sends the box to the model as it is, both lines included, so then keep only the request text in the box. ModelSamplingMiniMaxH3 (DGX Monarch) sets both MiniMax H3 shifts to 1.0, as the vendor's workflows do; without it the Workers would sample at H3's defaults, 12.0 and 3.0, so a one-frame latent with no shift node refuses (docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md #144). The sigmas are the vendor's 8-step grid, typed into Manual Sigmas; more steps do not help. Other 8 MP sizes: 3360x2496 for 4:3, 3552x2368 for 3:2 and 3872x2176 for 16:9, sides swapped for portrait, with the Aspect ratio: line to match. For an edit, wire images to p-h3-image Conditioning: image_1 is the image to edit and the rest are references; on hardware an edit on uly2 matched the same edit on one rank, and no edit has been compared with stock yet. The driver holds the text encoder, the upsampler and the VAE beside a 37.7 GiB DiT. The first render of a new model, LoRA and residency combination runs the identity gate before any pixels, on this graph's mesh and topology: proof renders of at most two steps, from a fresh load before and after the swap or reload under test, must match bit for bit, and with slab residency on, one more render with slab off must match too. Allow a few minutes for these two to four proof renders. Later renders of the same combination skip the gate. Expects p-h3-image_bf16.safetensors in models/diffusion_models, p-h3-image_text_encoder_bf16.safetensors and p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_bf16.safetensors in models/text_encoders, and p-h3-image_vae_bf16.safetensors in models/vae. This graph is derived from the family adapter and stock node definitions, without a committed reference render. Check filenames and shapes against your artifacts before running it."
   ],
   "title": "DGX Monarch | p-h3-image text to image"
  },
